    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "b8ab71dd-fd67-4ee8-af95-50a95a331f27",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E5* hotels throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions, entrance fees \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETwo dinners included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDirect scheduled flights to Delhi\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in India\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 15 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "40b1a77f-d77b-4443-afd2-914a25c516e6",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ETwo nights at the 5* The Surya Hotel in Delhi, one night at the 5* Double Tree by Hilton in Agra, two nights at the 5* Hilton Hotel in Jaipur and one night at the 5* Crowne Plaza Today Hotel in Delhi. Dinner is included on our first night in Jaipur (Day 5) and our last night in Delhi (Day 7) and the remaining nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "54fa80bb-8fdd-4ae9-b128-2c3a01e4f86b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDelhi - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJama Masjid\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERashtrapati Bahwan\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIndia Gate and Humanyun\u2019s Tomb\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EQutub Minar\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAgra Fort\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETaj Mahal\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFatehpur Sikri\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJaipur\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAmber Fort\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECity Palace\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJantar Mantar\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHawa Mahal\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "77840823-7291-4d62-b91b-a7a81a349e47",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOrcha - the palace fort complex of Orcha is a 17th century structure with three palaces or mahals\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKhajuraho Temples - built by the Chandela kings between 950 AD and 1050 AD, the most important is the Chaunset Rogini Temple dedicated to Godess Kali\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVaranasi - a sunrise boat trip on the River Ganges to see Varanasi come alive with people bathing in the holy water and worshipping the rising sun, as well as the conclusion of life at the river bank holy cremation grounds - it is believed if you die in Varanasi you go straight to heaven\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "141e9f72-c026-4f25-a6d0-88a5fbd2aa40",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Overnight to Delhi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled overnight flight from your preferred airport to Delhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Delhi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn arrival in Delhi transfer with our guide to the 5* The Surya Hotel for a two night stay on bed and breakfast basis \u2013 rest of the day is at leisure to explore Old Delhi laced by a maze of narrow lanes with graceful architecture and, in contrast, New Delhi created by the British with numerous fine colonial structures, magnificent buildings and wide boulevards.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Guided tour of Delhi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Delhi starts with a visit to Jama Masjid, Asia\u2019s largest mosque that can accommodate 20,000 people at one time \u2013 an included rickshaw ride takes us past the magnificent parliament building and Rashtrapati Bahwan, the official residence of the President of India and set in grounds designed by Sir Edward Lutyens \u2013 continue past India Gate and Humanyun\u2019s Tomb, built in the 16th century and architecturally considered the forerunner of the Taj Mahal \u2013 day concludes with a visit to Qutub Minar, a 72 metre tower dating back to the 13th century.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Agra Fort\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDrive to Agra, once the capital of the Mughal empire \u2013 this afternoon we visit Agra Fort, an outstanding example of Mughal architecture and the seat and stronghold of the Mughal Empire under successive generations \u2013 check in at the 5* Double Tree by Hilton in Agra for an overnight stay on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Taj Mahal, Fatehpur Sikri, Jaipur \u0026amp; dinner at the Narain Niwas Palace\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWitness the breath taking view of the Taj Mahal by sunrise \u2013 built by Emperor Shah Jahan for his favourite queen, Mumtaz Mahal, this exquisite white marble mausoleum was commissioned in 1631 and took 20,000 artisans 22 years to complete \u2013 en route to Jaipur we visit Fatehpur Sikri, the deserted red sandstone city that was built by Emperor Akbar as his capital before it was abandoned a few years later but whose \u0026#39;ruins\u0026#39; are still in pristine condition \u2013 on arrival in Jaipur, the \u2018Pink City\u2019 and the 18th century capital of Rajasthanm, we check in at the 5* Hilton Hotel for a two night stay \u2013 enjoy an included evening of traditional Rajput music and dance with dinner at the Narain Niwas Palace.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Amber Fort, City Palace, Jantar Mantar \u0026amp; Hawa Mahal\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn included elephant ride takes us to the Amber Fort, a 16th century honey coloured fortress palace in the Aravalli Hills decorated with intricate ivory, mirror and glass work complemented by exquisite wall paintings \u2013 in the afternoon we visit the City Palace with an imposing blend of traditional Rajasthani and Mughal Art and the awe inspiring Jantar Mantar, an accurate observatory built in 1726 AD \u2013 see the elegant fa\u00E7ade of the Hawa Mahal, the spectacular Palace of the Winds, built by King Sawai Pratap Singh in 1799.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Delhi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn our return to Delhi we check in at the 5* Crowne Plaza Today Hotel for an overnight stay \u2013 farewell dinner in our hotel tonight.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer by coach to Delhi Airport for our direct scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
